  "description": "Modern romance reader doodle clipart bundle inspired by BookTok culture, romance tropes, fictional men obsessions, bookstore dates, cozy reading habits, and trendy reader merchandise 📚❤️\nThis collection features bookish illustrations, playful romance reader phrases, bows, books, coffee, tickets, perfume bottles, and other reader-themed designs created in a clean monochrome doodle style perfect for modern merchandise and creative projects.\n✨ Perfect for:\n• Print on demand products\n• Stickers & sticker sheets\n• Tote bags & apparel\n• Bookmarks & reading journals\n• BookTok & Bookstagram content\n• Social media graphics\n• Romance reader merchandise\n💖 What’s included:\n– 20 high-quality illustrations\n– Transparent background\n– High resolution – 300 DPI (perfect for print & digital use)\n– 20 PNG files (transparent background)\n– 20 SVG files\n❤️ Included illustrations: Booked & Busy postage stamp, Enemies To Lovers heart sunglasses, Buy Me Books & Tell Me I’m Pretty banner, Slow Burn Society scroll, Booked tote bag, Tea & Fiction teacup, Fictional Men Club frame, Chapter 29 perfume bottle, Grumpy × Sunshine stamp, Bookstore Date coffee cups, Reading Is My Love Language frame, Plot Twist Princess banner, Fake Dating ticket, Love Story heart cake, Morally Gray Men frame, Forever Borrowed library card, Kissed By Fiction lipstick print, book bouquet, Booked For The Weekend ticket, and Romance Reader Starter Pack doodle collection.\nThis bundle is perfect for romance readers, BookTok fans, bookstore lovers, sticker makers, and small businesses looking for trendy bookish graphics. The illustrations work beautifully for tote bags, mugs, t-shirts, bookmarks, journals, phone cases, stickers, greeting cards, social media posts, and print on demand merchandise.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Modern romance reader doodle clipart bundle inspired by BookTok culture, romance tropes, fictional men obsessions, bookstore dates, cozy reading habits, and trendy reader merchandise 📚❤️<br>\nThis collection features bookish illustrations, playful romance reader phrases, bows, books, coffee, tickets, perfume bottles, and other reader-themed designs created in a clean monochrome doodle style perfect for modern merchandise and creative projects.</p>\n<p>✨ Perfect for:<br>\n• Print on demand products<br>\n• Stickers &amp; sticker sheets<br>\n• Tote bags &amp; apparel<br>\n• Bookmarks &amp; reading journals<br>\n• BookTok &amp; Bookstagram content<br>\n• Social media graphics<br>\n• Romance reader merchandise</p>\n<p>💖 What’s included:<br>\n– 20 high-quality illustrations<br>\n– Transparent background<br>\n– High resolution – 300 DPI (perfect for print &amp; digital use)<br>\n– 20 PNG files (transparent background)<br>\n– 20 SVG files</p>\n<p>❤️ Included illustrations: Booked &amp; Busy postage stamp, Enemies To Lovers heart sunglasses, Buy Me Books &amp; Tell Me I’m Pretty banner, Slow Burn Society scroll, Booked tote bag, Tea &amp; Fiction teacup, Fictional Men Club frame, Chapter 29 perfume bottle, Grumpy × Sunshine stamp, Bookstore Date coffee cups, Reading Is My Love Language frame, Plot Twist Princess banner, Fake Dating ticket, Love Story heart cake, Morally Gray Men frame, Forever Borrowed library card, Kissed By Fiction lipstick print, book bouquet, Booked For The Weekend ticket, and Romance Reader Starter Pack doodle collection.</p>\n<p>This bundle is perfect for romance readers, BookTok fans, bookstore lovers, sticker makers, and small businesses looking for trendy bookish graphics. The illustrations work beautifully for tote bags, mugs, t-shirts, bookmarks, journals, phone cases, stickers, greeting cards, social media posts, and print on demand merchandise.</p>",
